flowchart TD
    accTitle: M1 host convergence sequence
    accDescr: A receiving host polls, fetches, resumes safely, promotes and folds state, reviews the hold set, applies passing work, journals the outcome, and publishes a peer nudge. A clean floor exits early and a blocked verdict is held by name.
    A["1 · Poll<br/>Head check"] -->|new work| B["2 · Fetch<br/>Signed history"]
    A -->|clean floor| Z["Exit early<br/>Nothing to pull or push"]
    B --> C["3 · Resume<br/>Crash-resume check"]
    C --> D["4 · Promote<br/>Gate"]
    D --> E["5 · Fold<br/>Layers at reconcile point R"]
    E --> F["6 · Review<br/>Hold set"]
    F --> G["7 · Verdict<br/>Pass, hold, or refusal"]
    G -->|pass + canary evidence| I["8 · Apply<br/>Exact item"]
    G -->|blocked| J["Hold + alert<br/>Named reason"]
    I --> K["9 · Journal<br/>Applied / satisfied"]
    K --> L["10 · Publish<br/>Peer nudge"]
